### function on the left of and
set -e
migrate() { :; }
migrate && echo "migrated"
>>> none

### function on the left of or
set -e
migrate() { :; }
migrate || echo "migration failed"
>>> none

### negated function call
set -e
is_locked() { :; }
! is_locked
>>> none

